{
      "id": "L-S1E11-C04",
      "title": "Hope and Landon cake decorate",
      "description": "Hope and Landon cake decorate in the kitchen",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "talent_show",
        "romantic",
        "relationship",
        "teasing"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,


       "full": {
        "turns": [
         {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T01",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
          },
          "text": "If it's gooey, then it's not done."
          },
          {
         "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T02",
         "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
         },
         "text": "Are you sure cake decorating counts as a talent?"
        },
       {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T03",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Well, um, you told me that you don't know karate, then you stepped on my feet during salsa, and then you straight up refused to try synchronized ribbon dancing."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T04",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Sorry. My dignity wouldn't fit in the unitard."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T05",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "You know, it's not too late to pull out that notebook of lyrics that you have and sing something."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T06",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "I don't really sing in front of people, those songs are private."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T07",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Okay, well... cake decorating it is. And you know what? You're gonna like it."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T08",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "I like whatever's gotten into you lately."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T09",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Yeah? The only thing... that would make this day better..."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T10",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Huh?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T11",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Is if we went and got rid of that urn."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T12",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "As the person that stole the knife that started this whole thing, trust me, that sounds like a bad idea."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T13",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "It'll be fun. It'll be like a road trip. We'll just grab the damn thing and take it wherever it leads us."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T14",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "From what that Necromancer told you, Malivore is where that leads us, and we have no idea where that is. Are you feeling okay?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T15",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "We can talk about it on the road."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T16",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "I... The cake. Oh...Hope, can you get the vent."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T17",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Oh, my God! Landon. What is that?"
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C04-T18",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "You ever see Wrath of Khan?"
      }
    
    ]
  },
