    {
      "id": "L-S1E11-C06",
      "title": "Hope and Landon solve the monster with Dorian",
      "description": "Hope and Landon solve the monster with Dorian",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Dorian",
          "version": "Dorian"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "unicorn",
        "monster"
      ],
      "importance": 1,
      "verified": true,


       "full": {
        "turns": [
         {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T01",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Dorian",
          "version": "Dorian"
          },
          "text": "Okay, we have no idea how long the unicorn was infected before it keeled over, so we should figure this out right now."
          },
          {
         "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T02",
         "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
         },
         "text": "I thought only one monster comes for the urn at a time."
        },
       {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T03",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Dorian",
          "version": "Dorian"
        },
        "text": "Except the unicorn wasn't the monster. It was just the host to this thing. A parasite. It hitched a ride here in that Trojan horse, and then it moved on to us. From what Hope describes, it sounds like it latches onto the prefrontal cortex, the part of the brain associated with inhibitions."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T04",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "So, I was slug-drunk?"
      },
      {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T05",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Dorian",
          "version": "Dorian"
          },
          "text": "Since we have multiple slugs, it must replicate inside the host, and then lie in wait for the opportunity to infect someone else."
          },

          {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T06",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "I'm good on the gory details, thank you. How do we stop it?"
      },
      {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T07",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Dorian",
          "version": "Dorian"
          },
          "text": "I can't find any ancient legends about a creature like this."
          },

      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T08",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Invasion of the Body Snatchers? The Faculty. I say again, Wrath of Khan. Sci-fi is our modern-day myths. Meaning they could have been inspired by something, right? In those movies, it's all about mind control. Before the slug popped out, Hope wanted to take the urn someplace. I'm guessing Malivore."
      },
      {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T09",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Dorian",
          "version": "Dorian"
          },
          "text": "So, it's like an infection. It gets worse as it spreads. Stage one, it-it lowers your inhibitions. It makes you act out of character. Stage two, once you're susceptible to suggestion, you'll do whatever the slug wants."
          },
        {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T10",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Till stage three. You go the way of the unicorn."
      },
      {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T11",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
          },
          "text": "Did you see this? Parts of this thing look bioluminescent."
          },
          {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T12",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Dorian",
          "version": "Dorian"
        },
        "text": "Let me check that out."
      },
      {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T13",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Handon"
          },
          "text": "Whoa."
          },
          
        {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T14",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Dorian",
          "version": "Dorian"
        },
        "text": "See that?"
      },
       {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T15",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
          },
          "text": "I don't want to know, do I?"
          },

          {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T16",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Probably not."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T17",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Dorian",
          "version": "Dorian"
        },
        "text": "Nope. Nope. You know what? We can use these lights to find anyone who's been infected."
      }
    ]
  },

  "short": {
    "turns": [
      {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T15",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
          },
          "text": "I don't want to know, do I?"
          },

          {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C06-T16",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "Probably not."
      }
