       "full": {
        "turns": [
         {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T01",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
          },
          "text": "I sealed the doors with a spell, but it won't hold forever."
          },
          {
         "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T02",
         "speaker": {
          "character": "Dorian",
          "version": "Dorian"
         },
         "text": "All right. These chains should help until we come up with a better solution. I'll get the doors downstairs."
        },
       {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T03",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "At least we have all the infected people in one place."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T04",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "So, I was slug-drunk?"
      },
      {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T05",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Lizzie",
          "version": "Lizzie"
          },
          "text": "What are you two doing out here?"
          },

          {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T06",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Lizzie",
          "version": "Lizzie"
        },
        "text": "Have you two gone crazy?"
      },
      {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T07",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
          },
          "text": "You've been infected with a mind-controlling parasite. That's why you've been so nice all day."
          },

      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T08",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Lizzie",
          "version": "Lizzie"
        },
        "text": "That is not why I have been... hey!"
      },
      {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T09",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
          },
          "text": "I don't see any slug trails."
          },
        {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T10",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Lizzie",
          "version": "Lizzie"
        },
        "text": "What are you freaks talking a... ow."
      },
      {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T11",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
          },
          "text": "What was that?"
          },
          {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T12",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Lizzie",
          "version": "Lizzie"
        },
        "text": "Unchain me, and maybe I will tell you, you thrift store hobbit."
      },
      {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T13",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
          },
          "text": "I don't think she's infected."
          },
          
        {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T14",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Then why are you acting so weird?"
      },
       {
          "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T15",
          "speaker": {
          "character": "Lizzie",
          "version": "Lizzie"
          },
          "text": "I'm not acting weird, I am turning over a new leaf. With this... I spelled it to zap me whenever I said anything mean. And in increasing voltage. Worst idea ever."
          },

          {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T16",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        "text": "No. That's genius. That's why there's no slug in her. She's been zapping herself."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T17",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "Then why are you wandering around here, instead of at the talent show like everyone else?"
      },

       {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T18",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Lizzie",
          "version": "Lizzie"
        },
        "text": "I was looking for Josie. She's been acting weird all day and then she just bailed on the performance. Probably because she's infected."
      },
      {
        "id": "L-S1E11-C08-T19",
        "speaker": {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        "text": "We need to find her, now."
      }
    ]
  },

